A '''bladed weapon''' is any [[weapon]] which has a sharp edge designed to either [[slashing damage|slash]] or [[piercing damage|pierce]] an opponent.

==Notes==
* The geometry of the blade makes certain weapons more effective at [[piercing damage|piercing]] opponents.
** These include [[rapier]]s and [[shortsword]]s
* Other bladed weapons are capable of dealing [[piercing-slashing damage|piercing and slashing]] damage with a single attack.
** These include [[halberd]]s and [[scythe]]s

